sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as onm
    participant Cfg as config
    participant Disc as scan::discovery
    participant Enrich as project + size
    participant UI as ui
    participant Del as delete
    participant FS as filesystem

    User->>CLI: onm [path] with flags
    CLI->>Cfg: load .onmignore and .onmfavorites
    Cfg-->>CLI: exclude globs + favorites

    CLI->>Disc: discover root with ScanOptions
    Disc->>FS: parallel walk, pruning node_modules
    FS-->>Disc: candidate paths
    Note over Disc: hidden skipped unless --hidden,<br/>.onmignore applied, --max-depth honored
    Disc-->>CLI: discovered paths

    alt root missing
        CLI-->>User: "error: scan root does not exist", exit 1
    else root exists
        CLI->>Enrich: enrich each path via rayon
        Enrich->>FS: size, packages, package.json, .git root
        FS-->>Enrich: metadata
        Enrich-->>CLI: NodeModulesInfo + per-target errors
        Note over CLI: spinner: Discovering, Sizing, Done
    end

    alt --scan or --json
        CLI->>UI: sort, then table or JSON
        UI-->>User: sizes + totals, nothing deleted
    else --auto
        CLI->>UI: filter by --min-size, preview up to 10
        opt neither --dry-run nor --yes
            UI->>User: Delete N directories?
            User-->>UI: confirm or cancel
        end
        UI->>Del: delete_selected(selected, opts)
    else interactive (default)
        CLI->>UI: summary line + multiselect
        UI->>User: pick entries, favorites start deselected
        User-->>UI: selection
        UI->>User: Delete N directories?
        User-->>UI: confirm or cancel
        UI->>Del: delete_selected(selected, opts)
    end

    Note over Del: safety check: ends in node_modules, exists,<br/>has a subdir or parent has package.json,<br/>lockfile untouched for 60s unless --no-check
    par rayon, one task per target
        Del->>FS: remove_dir_all or the --force chain
    and a failing target is recorded
        Del->>Del: continue, never abort the batch
    end
    Del-->>UI: bytes freed + per-target details
    UI-->>User: Freed TOTAL from N directories
